riginal on 2025-03-07. Retrieved 2025-03-05.\\n09. **[^](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cursor_(code_editor)#cite_ref-9 \\"Jump up\\")**Edwards, Benj (2025-04-17). [\\"Company apologizes after AI support agent invents policy that causes user uproar\\"](https://arstechnica.com/ai/2025/04/cursor-ai-support-bot-invents-fake-policy-and-triggers-user-uproar/). _Ars Technica_. [Archived](https://web.archive.org/web/20250421202614/https://arstechnica.com/ai/2025/04/cursor-ai-support-bot-invents-fake-policy-and-triggers-user-uproar/) from the original on 2025-04-21. Retrieved 2025-04-22.\\n10. **[^](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cursor_(code_editor)#cite_ref-10 \\"Jump up\\")**[\\"Cursor Privacy and Security\\"](https://www.cursor.com/security). _Cursor_. [Archived](https://web.archive.org/web/20241219225848/https://www.cursor.com/security) from the original on 2024-12-19. Retrieved 2024-12-20.\\n11. **[^](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cursor_(code_editor)#cite_ref-11 \\"Jump up\\")**[\\"Cursor Community and Adoption\\"](https://www.cursor.com/testimonials). _Cursor_. Retrieved 2024-12-20.\\n\\n## External links\\n\\n\\\\[ [edit](https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Cursor_(code_editor)&action=edit&section=8 \\"Edit section: External links\\")\\\\]\\n\\n- [Official website](https://www.cursor.com/)\\n\\nRetrieved from \\" [https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Cursor\\\\_(code\\\\_editor)&oldid=1290538897](https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Cursor_(code_editor)&oldid=1290538897)\\"\\n\\n[Categories](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:Category \\"Help:Category\\"):\\n\\n- [Integrated development environments](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:Integrated_development_environments \\"Category:Integrated development environments\\")\\n- [Free software distributions](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:Free_software_distributions \\"Category:Free software distributions\\")\\n\\nHidden categories:\\n\\n- [Articles with short description](https://en.wikipe